  "details": "I would like to say that the moderation of instances is unfortunately underdone. More often than not, I've had negative experiences of bullying and usually got kicked before I could report the users or get their usernames. I am suggesting here that potentially, there could be an feature put in that records a video of the involved instance that only the user can see and they can send it to vrchat moderation for improved moderation and there could also be extra monitoring of group publics and general public instances since they're the most common instances.",
